{"id":"08633972042eedcd","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-swingchow.md","title":"Swing numbers from modified Chow parameters","display":"thm-swingchow — Swing numbers from modified Chow parameters","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-swingchow","aliases":["27-thm-swingchow"],"display":"thm-swingchow — Swing numbers from modified Chow parameters","depends_on":["[[27-df-swingbanzhaf]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.13.3 Definition 1.32; Theorem 1.37","source_printed_pages":"57","source_pdf_pages":"81","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-swingchow"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-swingchow</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-swingchow — Swing numbers from modified Chow parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4cce6c7a39335fa2\" href=\"?note=4cce6c7a39335fa2\" title=\"27-df-swingbanzhaf\">27-df-swingbanzhaf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.13.3 Definition 1.32; Theorem 1.37"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"57"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"81"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 非常值，且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;((\\forall i\\in[n]\\;a_i\\le b_i)\\Rightarrow f(a)\\le f(b))\">\\(\\forall a,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;((\\forall i\\in[n]\\;a_i\\le b_i)\\Rightarrow f(a)\\le f(b))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_k(f),s_k(f)\">\\(S_k(f),s_k(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4cce6c7a39335fa2\" href=\"?note=4cce6c7a39335fa2\" title=\"27-df-swingbanzhaf\">27-df-swingbanzhaf</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega,\\omega_k\">\\(\\omega,\\omega_k\\)</span> 是下节构造的真点计数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[n]\">\\(k\\in[n]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\coloneqq|\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}|,\\qquad\\omega_k\\coloneqq|\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\land a_k=1\\}|\\quad(k\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\omega\\coloneqq|\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}|,\\qquad\\omega_k\\coloneqq|\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\land a_k=1\\}|\\quad(k\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\coloneqq\\omega-2^{n-1},\\qquad\\pi_k\\coloneqq2\\omega_k-\\omega\\quad(k\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi\\coloneqq\\omega-2^{n-1},\\qquad\\pi_k\\coloneqq2\\omega_k-\\omega\\quad(k\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in[n]\\;s_k(f)=\\pi_k,\\qquad\\forall k\\in[n]\\;\\left(s_k(f)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(a^{k\\gets0})=f(a^{k\\gets1})\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in[n]\\;s_k(f)=\\pi_k,\\qquad\\forall k\\in[n]\\;\\left(s_k(f)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(a^{k\\gets0})=f(a^{k\\gets1})\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把第 k 位为 1 的真点与其第 k 位为 0 的配对点对应：配对点要么仍为真，要么恰是摇摆点。于是 ω_k=(ω−ω_k)+s_k，得到原书 Theorem 1.37。递增性排除由 1 到 0 的反向变化，故无摇摆点等价于该变量不本质；这一附加等价在本页给出直接证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-swingbanzhaf","status":"resolved","id":"4cce6c7a39335fa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-swingbanzhaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-swingbanzhaf","status":"resolved","id":"4cce6c7a39335fa2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 非常值，且满足 $\\forall a,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;((\\forall i\\in[n]\\;a_i\\le b_i)\\Rightarrow f(a)\\le f(b))$，$S_k(f),s_k(f)$ 见 [[27-df-swingbanzhaf]]。$\\omega,\\omega_k$ 是下节构造的真点计数，$k\\in[n]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;((\\forall i\\in[n]\\;a_i\\le b_i)\\Rightarrow f(a)\\le f(b))","display":false},{"tex":"S_k(f),s_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega,\\omega_k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\coloneqq|\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\}|,\\qquad\\omega_k\\coloneqq|\\{a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\mid f(a)=1\\land a_k=1\\}|\\quad(k\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi\\coloneqq\\omega-2^{n-1},\\qquad\\pi_k\\coloneqq2\\omega_k-\\omega\\quad(k\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in[n]\\;s_k(f)=\\pi_k,\\qquad\\forall k\\in[n]\\;\\left(s_k(f)=0\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(a^{k\\gets0})=f(a^{k\\gets1})\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1799,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-swingchow|thm-swingchow — Swing numbers from modified Chow parameters]]"},{"id":"d10bf908ef5dd0f3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原段落实际保留的修改主题包括投票指标的递增前提、零维距离记号、局部构造、索引及书内直接依赖。可对应阅读 [[27-df-swingbanzhaf]]、[[27-thm-swingchow]] 和 [[27-df-pbunimodality]]；本摘要不推断未列出的39个历史修改文件，也不凭数字3指定未给出的完整历史证据清单。"}],"outgoing":["4cce6c7a39335fa2"]}